  "vibe": "The only script face in this set — Lobster Two over Cabin — and and it stays in sentence case throughout. Deep leaf #2e4636 with a monarch orange #f28c28 that swallows the whole CTA frame, plus a morpho blue #4a7de0 that appears exactly where a second butterfly is needed. The world is a glasshouse: three butterflies drift left to right at different speeds, banking up to fourteen degrees while their wings flap by squashing on the X axis nine times a second — the middle one blue, the outer two orange. Three cream-stemmed flowers sway from the bottom edge with five-petal blooms, and faint six-percent light shafts rake down from the top right. Checks tick themselves on, garden news pops in as staggered pills, nectar is dragged into place. Calm camera, wide slow drift.",
